# INVENTION-DIVERSITY, COMBINED RUN (user decision 2026-08-08: combine
# with the 8.4x recording code). 9 runs (3 unstable legs x 3 draws),
# PARALLEL=6, ~2-3M tokens, -n 8 -m 20 (baseline was -n 5 -m 12).
#
# TWO purposes, ONE narrowed pre-registration:
#
# (1) INVENT-MORE READ — the only comparison against the 8.29 baseline
#     that COUNTS: invention-level metrics (which check families were
#     invented, in how many draws; killer-check family present?). These
#     are upstream of everything the 8.4x recording touches, so they
#     attribute cleanly to -n 8.
#     OUTCOME TABLES ARE RECORDED BUT EXPLICITLY NON-COMPARABLE to the
#     baseline: this run also carries the 8.4x recording (enriched
#     replay-conviction messages reach the judge; receiver-capture can
#     drop a non-compiling relation), so outcome shifts have two
#     possible causes and must not be attributed to either. Roll-13
#     rule, applied in advance.
#
# (2) P1B MATERIAL — first run with firing-state recording live: replay
#     firings carry `[relfire] <message> __consumed=... __rcvstate ...`.
#     Math-65-c's replay convictions are the target sample. The gate's
#     void/corroborate rules get designed against these recorded lines.
#
# READ, per leg: invention table (check families x draws, vs baseline),
# outcome table (recorded, non-comparable — no banking anything),
# tokens/leg vs baseline 131-250k, and EVERY [relfire] line quoted in
# full (the p1b corpus). Fail-closed checks: zero facts from discarded
# references; any gate VOID event on an overfit leg = hard stop.
MODEL="gpt-5.4"
COMMON="-n 8 -m 20 --fuzz_timeout 20 --verify_timeout 20 --verify_relations --synthesize_relations --replay_relations_on_patched --rule_compile_repair --reference_impl"
CASES=(
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
  "-c patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Dcorrect/CapGen/Math/patch1-Math-65-CapGen.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Chart/patch1-Chart-19-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
  "-o patchfile:/home/code/drr/Patches/Doverfitting/Arja/Lang/patch1-Lang-63-Arja-plausible.patch"
)
